 (verdict Inconclusive)
 (notes
  "The ledger verdict type has no Invalid, so this entry carries Inconclusive. All three pre-registered reads are INVALID: V6 fails on 5 of 5 seeds of every read (validator_diff -check V6 exit 1 on 15/15 pairs), leaving 0 valid seeds. Cause: the pit-v13 composition lists keep rename twins (one instrument under two symbols in the same year): GLPG/LKFT (S3, every seed), CMD/CMN, KONA/KONAQ and NCS/CNR_old2 (U4), EURN/CMBT (UN4); 12 of 20 cells held one instrument as two positions; 439 of 512 v12 top-3000 twin-drop rows have both legs back in the same year's v13 top-3000 list, and pit_twin_cooccur_check.sh cannot see it (each list is checked only against its own drops file). Descriptive shapes, NOT verdicts: U4 vs S3 median delta +0.045 (3/5 positive, every seed inside the 0.45-log floor), median dDD -3.36 pp, INCONCLUSIVE-shaped; N3 vs S3 median -1.091 (5/5 negative), median dDD +16.18 pp, HARM-shaped; UN4 vs U4 median -2.101 (5/5 negative), median dDD +21.02 pp, HARM-shaped; interaction (UN4-N3)-(U4-S3) median -0.778, negative on 5/5. Median ln(final/initial): S3 2.1185, U4 2.3311, N3 1.0907, UN4 0.3376. WHY (of the shapes): U4 substitutes 127-136 deep-band round trips per seed for top-3000 ones and re-draws the path (only 59-62 % of S3 round trips survive at the same seed); N3 places 86-88 % of entries on about-4 % Buffer_fallback stops sized to the 14 % cap, cash binds on nearly every buying Friday, and S3's tail entries are crowded out (ODSY 2009, MMYT 2023, APPS 2020, BGO 2003); UN4 sends the deep band through the fallback door (77-84 % of its deep-band round trips) and its realised P&L is negative on 4/5 seeds. Decisions unchanged: weekly picks stay on top-3000; require_structural_stop false stays non-promotable (spine item 5); addendum A1-A4 not triggered. Blocking defect: the v13 lists are unfit for any measured cell (including a record re-baseline) until the twin dedupe is repaired (re-apply the v12 drops, scan the 11-23 additions store-wide, add a cross-vintage co-occurrence check extending #3713). Power: a clean K=5 rerun of S3/U4 reaches the PASS shape at +0.3 log with probability 0.68 and at +0.4 with 0.87. Writeup: dev/experiments/universe-depth-2026-11-23/RESULTS.md."))
